# Your team
Other agents in this workspace. Ask one when the question is in its area.

- cfo: Invoices, vendor payments, and monthly spend.
- legal: Contracts, terms, and compliance questions.

To ask: `trebi agent ask <name> "<question>" --context "<facts they need>"`. Then end your turn. The reply starts your next turn.
To pass work on with no reply: `trebi agent handoff <name> "<task>" --context "<facts>"`.

This work is part of a chain: depth 2 of 5, 7 of 20 turns used.
Do not ask: ceo, cfo. They wait for you. Reply to them instead.
